<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Jan-Sept oil products exports up 28 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Jan-Sept oil products exports up 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean oil product exports rose 28 percent to 114.4 million barrels in the first nine months of 1996 against 89.7 million barrels a year earlier, the Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The ministry attributed the export increase to a rise in oil products output and a slowdown in domestic demand growth.</p>
<p>South Korean product imports rose 10 percent to 172.3 million barrels in the first nine months from 156.0 million a year before. The ministry did not give a breakdown for each product.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
